Description: Build interactive spot maps for epidemiological case-control
    data in India. Supports automatic detection of latitude, longitude, and
    outcome columns, spatial joining with bundled state and district
    boundaries, and produces interactive 'HTML' maps with dot-density and
    spot-pin display modes. The bundled India state and district boundaries
    are sourced from the Survey of India and used under the Government Open
    Data License - India (GODL-India,
    <https://data.gov.in/government-open-data-license-india>).
